{"id":5448,"date":"2025-09-17T23:22:49","date_gmt":"2025-09-17T16:22:49","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/?p=5448"},"modified":"2025-09-25T20:23:11","modified_gmt":"2025-09-25T13:23:11","slug":"trinh-quan-ly-quang-cao-tiktok","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/kien-thuc-tiktok\/trinh-quan-ly-quang-cao-tiktok\/","title":{"rendered":"C\u00e1ch thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp tr\u00ecnh qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o TikTok chi ti\u1ebft"},"content":{"rendered":"<div data-page-id=\"OBu9dCruzoOvgfxna5RlqLm0gAe\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PsghdOAPBo8QlZxTDuUl4HHMgy4\">\u0110\u1ec3 khai th\u00e1c t\u1ed1i \u0111a ti\u1ec1m n\u0103ng th\u01b0\u01a1ng m\u1ea1i kh\u1ed5ng l\u1ed3 t\u1eeb TikTok, vi\u1ec7c hi\u1ec3u v\u00e0 l\u00e0m ch\u1ee7 <strong>Tr\u00ecnh qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o TikTok<\/strong> l\u00e0 b\u01b0\u1edbc \u0111i kh\u00f4ng th\u1ec3 thi\u1ebfu c\u1ee7a m\u1ecdi doanh nghi\u1ec7p. \u0110\u00e2y ch\u00ednh l\u00e0 trung t\u00e2m ch\u1ec9 huy, n\u01a1i b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o ra c\u00e1c chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o, ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn ch\u00ednh x\u00e1c kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau v\u00e0 \u0111o l\u01b0\u1eddng hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch minh b\u1ea1ch. B\u00e0i vi\u1ebft n\u00e0y s\u1ebd l\u00e0 c\u1ea9m nang chi ti\u1ebft, d\u1eabn d\u1eaft b\u1ea1n t\u1eeb nh\u1eefng b\u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\u1ea7u ti\u00ean \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n \u0111\u1ebfn vi\u1ec7c l\u00e0m quen v\u1edbi c\u1ea5u tr\u00fac c\u1ee7a m\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p, gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n t\u1ef1 tin b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u h\u00e0nh tr\u00ecnh qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng n\u00e0y c\u00f9ng <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Lemon Digital<\/a><\/strong>.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UqDSdtekEoyVUuxnzX2lFYUQgef\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-WKZGdHiTcoKg84xSKzMl5k01goc\">Tr\u00ecnh qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o TikTok l\u00e0 g\u00ec?<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AEgkdjt8yo3X3qxfVMElPv31gQD\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-CkVsdGixPo2BeFx2KQ6lZv4hgSh\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;c8fdf6f6-fcbd-4fc1-9576-efdd96218a67&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FBBHUbDqc5oQNApxDTbTlw3J7gYe%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;BBHUbDqc5oQNApxDTbTlw3J7gYe&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:271007,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5449\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5449\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5449\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/1280X1280-31.png\" alt=\"Tr\u00ecnh qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o TikTok l\u00e0 g\u00ec?\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/1280X1280-31.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/1280X1280-31-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/1280X1280-31-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/1280X1280-31-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/1280X1280-31-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5449\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>Tr\u00ecnh qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o TikTok l\u00e0 g\u00ec?<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SEkodjv6UoVJfixcCSIldi2hgsg\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BXekddinhov3fbxI33Gl7bVdgZb\"><strong>Tr\u00ecnh qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o TikTok (TikTok Ads Manager)<\/strong> l\u00e0 n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng t\u1ea5t-c\u1ea3-trong-m\u1ed9t do TikTok cung c\u1ea5p, cho ph\u00e9p c\u00e1c doanh nghi\u1ec7p v\u00e0 nh\u00e0 qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o t\u1ef1 t\u1ea1o, qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd, theo d\u00f5i v\u00e0 t\u1ed1i \u01b0u h\u00f3a c\u00e1c chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh tr\u00ean TikTok v\u00e0 c\u00e1c \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c. C\u00f3 th\u1ec3 xem \u0111\u00e2y l\u00e0 &#8220;b\u1ea3ng \u0111i\u1ec1u khi\u1ec3n&#8221; trung t\u00e2m cho m\u1ecdi ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o tr\u1ea3 ph\u00ed c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n tr\u00ean h\u1ec7 sinh th\u00e1i TikTok.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PFjBdB0sLozgmHxJzeKlogregEd\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-OnZldYnsMoWGFQxojn3lQFQagAf\">V\u00ec sao n\u00ean s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng Tr\u00ecnh qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o TikTok?<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Sin5dS9x9o7bXyxR7qJlJoLhgdT\">Thay v\u00ec ch\u1ec9 qu\u1ea3ng b\u00e1 th\u00f4ng qua c\u00e1c t\u00ednh n\u0103ng c\u00f3 s\u1eb5n tr\u00ean \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng, vi\u1ec7c s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng Tr\u00ecnh qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p s\u1ebd m\u1edf ra cho b\u1ea1n nh\u1eefng quy\u1ec1n n\u0103ng v\u01b0\u1ee3t tr\u1ed9i:<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-FKF9dvBxzo8bGpxoIp3lgnRMgah\">Cung c\u1ea5p nhi\u1ec1u \u0111\u1ecbnh d\u1ea1ng qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GwUhdlAcsoU8APxlBw1lw4Xhgdb\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5450\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5450\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5450\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/1280X1280-32.png\" alt=\"Cung c\u1ea5p nhi\u1ec1u \u0111\u1ecbnh d\u1ea1ng qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/1280X1280-32.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/1280X1280-32-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/1280X1280-32-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/1280X1280-32-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/1280X1280-32-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5450\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>Cung c\u1ea5p nhi\u1ec1u \u0111\u1ecbnh d\u1ea1ng qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-SOvndKaZWoBNadxhrV9liTDxgWd\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;dd94d717-0ba1-45fa-895c-648d952c134b&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FPN7rb6CvWoSAZFxWK2kltEifgFe%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;PN7rb6CvWoSAZFxWK2kltEifgFe&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:685958,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JvVNdZS5ioLinCxIaDwlXX0sgWg\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZEuedtojOoOy3vxg4Kyl9bMtg4d\">B\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng qua nhi\u1ec1u h\u00ecnh th\u1ee9c h\u1ea5p d\u1eabn nh\u01b0 qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o trong lu\u1ed3ng (In-feed ads), qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u (TopView, Brand Takeover), qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o hi\u1ec7u \u1ee9ng (Branded Effects),&#8230; gi\u00fap chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch tr\u1edf n\u00ean sinh \u0111\u1ed9ng v\u00e0 hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 h\u01a1n.<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-NkXRdhks4oKfUexRP5yl1C12gGc\">Nh\u1eafm m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng chi ti\u1ebft v\u00e0 n\u00e2ng cao<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WfsBdd0wPoFzbOx7StKlX4lCgNe\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-Eef6d6ijEojVVYxfvJKlf6l6gvg\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;4e319ac8-393b-43df-9ca9-706e194bcba6&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FWbEpbB1JWoOYWLxLfABlCyfKgVh%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;WbEpbB1JWoOYWLxLfABlCyfKgVh&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:237730,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5451\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5451\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5451\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/1280X1280-33.png\" alt=\"Tr\u00ecnh qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o TikTok h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 nh\u1eafm m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng chi ti\u1ebft v\u00e0 n\u00e2ng cao\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/1280X1280-33.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/1280X1280-33-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/1280X1280-33-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/1280X1280-33-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/1280X1280-33-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5451\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>Tr\u00ecnh qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o TikTok h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 nh\u1eafm m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng chi ti\u1ebft v\u00e0 n\u00e2ng cao<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PwQ9do4CjoOgSjxSD3ild0G8gEd\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FYHTdys7zob1CsxCWwPlmJvngnd\">C\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 cho ph\u00e9p b\u1ea1n nh\u1eafm m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o d\u1ef1a tr\u00ean c\u00e1c ti\u00eau ch\u00ed s\u00e2u r\u1ed9ng nh\u01b0:<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ml44dU2Atos8N8xEpyklPaUXgBb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Nh\u00e2n kh\u1ea9u h\u1ecdc:<\/strong> \u0110\u1ed9 tu\u1ed5i, gi\u1edbi t\u00ednh, v\u1ecb tr\u00ed \u0111\u1ecba l\u00fd, ng\u00f4n ng\u1eef.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DJqNdeIMlo7UQBxkgdilcr42gUc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>S\u1edf th\u00edch &amp; H\u00e0nh vi:<\/strong> C\u00e1c lo\u1ea1i video h\u1ecd xem, c\u00e1c nh\u00e0 s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o h\u1ecd theo d\u00f5i, c\u00e1c hashtag h\u1ecd t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IbC2dStGioFTfsxxolPlnLB0guc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>\u0110\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng t\u00f9y ch\u1ec9nh:<\/strong> T\u1ea3i l\u00ean t\u1ec7p kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng c\u1ee