200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/f0e758bc-635d-47a7-b7cb-20cdd4b8ba59-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/f0e758bc-635d-47a7-b7cb-20cdd4b8ba59-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/f0e758bc-635d-47a7-b7cb-20cdd4b8ba59-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/f0e758bc-635d-47a7-b7cb-20cdd4b8ba59-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5535\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>B\u01b0\u1edbc 3: Cung c\u1ea5p c\u00e1c th\u00f4ng tin chi ti\u1ebft v\u1ec1 doanh nghi\u1ec7p<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Hj2td4VKqoVf2oxbqDhlc9XNgVe\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LZ45du53Nos5Tsxz3XtlKZIfgMb\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 4:<\/strong> \u0110\u1ed3ng \u00fd v\u1edbi c\u00e1c \u0111i\u1ec1u kho\u1ea3n v\u00e0 nh\u1ea5n &#8220;<strong>\u0110\u0103ng k\u00fd<\/strong>&#8220;. Sau khi ho\u00e0n t\u1ea5t, b\u1ea1n s\u1ebd \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ebfn giao di\u1ec7n ch\u00ednh c\u1ee7a Tr\u00ecnh qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o.<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E86TdnqUHo79AzxhGZelE9uEgsh\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\n<figure id=\"attachment_5536\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5536\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5536\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/e41d0695-420b-422e-8ac5-1e92bb81eb36.png\" alt=\"Ho\u00e0n t\u1ea5t, b\u1ea1n s\u1ebd \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ebfn giao di\u1ec7n ch\u00ednh c\u1ee7a Tr\u00ecnh qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/e41d0695-420b-422e-8ac5-1e92bb81eb36.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/e41d0695-420b-422e-8ac5-1e92bb81eb36-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/e41d0695-420b-422e-8ac5-1e92bb81eb36-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/e41d0695-420b-422e-8ac5-1e92bb81eb36-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/e41d0695-420b-422e-8ac5-1e92bb81eb36-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5536\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>Ho\u00e0n t\u1ea5t, b\u1ea1n s\u1ebd \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ebfn giao di\u1ec7n ch\u00ednh c\u1ee7a Tr\u00ecnh qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"OBu9dCruzoOvgfxna5RlqLm0gAe\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-UCT9dtWemoVVnnxdh2YlgkoGgLf\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;ebb3f2fa-afb3-4f6d-8ce4-aeedd77265f3&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FXCWebYWXbo8B5ZxypaplCHfzg9g%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;XCWebYWXbo8B5ZxypaplCHfzg9g&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:262516,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-U0dJdu3Eso7SWDx7f4YlW89tgTc\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YXmgdglSqoUmsPxWzxDl2mKag7y\"><strong>L\u01b0u \u00fd quan tr\u1ecdng:<\/strong> \u0110\u1ed1i v\u1edbi c\u00e1c doanh nghi\u1ec7p mu\u1ed1n ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p v\u00e0 nh\u1eadn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c s\u1ef1 h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 t\u1ed1t nh\u1ea5t, vi\u1ec7c s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng <strong>T\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o Agency<\/strong> l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn t\u1ed1i \u01b0u. C\u00e1c \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c c\u1ee7a TikTok nh\u01b0 Lemon Digital c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 c\u1ea5p t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o Agency, gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n nh\u1eadn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c s\u1ef1 t\u01b0 v\u1ea5n tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp t\u1eeb TikTok khi g\u1eb7p l\u1ed7i, m\u1edf c\u00e1c t\u00ednh n\u0103ng qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o m\u1edbi v\u00e0 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 t\u1ed1i \u01b0u chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 h\u01a1n.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-O6sqd3ZKNoQqSYxp4XHlVe1Lg1c\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-VXrsdD4wpokqzkxGarzl4QMxg9g\">L\u00e0m quen v\u1edbi giao di\u1ec7n Tr\u00ecnh qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o TikTok<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EBsJdtOG2oyjFmxEcCRlzmaAgAf\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-Pdf5dFq0foKcjixkzm4lFUnfgch\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;95198695-2d26-4edb-a516-f807e47fc6f6&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FDBosbcjl1oZwFhxnOCnlof3cgrg%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;DBosbcjl1oZwFhxnOCnlof3cgrg&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:190713,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5537\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5537\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5537\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/f6dd7921-c038-4bdb-ae78-5cd9467c2fa1.png\" alt=\"L\u00e0m quen v\u1edbi giao di\u1ec7n Tr\u00ecnh qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o TikTok\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/f6dd7921-c038-4bdb-ae78-5cd9467c2fa1.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/f6dd7921-c038-4bdb-ae78-5cd9467c2fa1-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/f6dd7921-c038-4bdb-ae78-5cd9467c2fa1-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/f6dd7921-c038-4bdb-ae78-5cd9467c2fa1-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/f6dd7921-c038-4bdb-ae78-5cd9467c2fa1-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5537\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>L\u00e0m quen v\u1edbi giao di\u1ec7n Tr\u00ecnh qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o TikTok<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QHcUdbclkoAY58x6MMXlF8i6gEg\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Qvr5dTFtqoPTfZxJWKKlGMiIgwb\">Giao di\u1ec7n ch\u00ednh c\u1ee7a c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c chia th\u00e0nh 4 khu v\u1ef1c ch\u00ednh:<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-CQYEdL1YJowZjexv7LhlnAZdg9d\">B\u1ea3ng \u0111i\u1ec1u khi\u1ec3n (Dashboard)<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MuwDdOD0Uo8zdQx2yNsl1Fjwg1J\">\u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 trang t\u1ed5ng quan, n\u01a1i hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb c\u00e1c ch\u1ec9 s\u1ed1 hi\u1ec7u su\u1ea5t ch\u00ednh c\u1ee7a t\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 c\u00e1c chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch \u0111ang ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng, gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 c\u00e1i nh\u00ecn nhanh v\u1ec1 t\u00ecnh h\u00ecnh chung.<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-PrNedb6IloSh17xxydulraS5geb\">Tab Chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch (Campaign)<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YhA1du85FovZAlxvP91lLEPbg1c\">\u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 khu v\u1ef1c l\u00e0m vi\u1ec7c ch\u00ednh c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n. T\u1ea1i \u0111\u00e2y, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch m\u1edbi, ch\u1ec9nh s\u1eeda c\u00e1c chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch, nh\u00f3m qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o v\u00e0 qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o hi\u1ec7n c\u00f3, c\u0169ng nh\u01b0 b\u1eadt\/t\u1eaft ch\u00fang.<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-XreKdVY2oof8j2xEa0PlBViUgne\">Tab T\u00e0i s\u1ea3n (Assets)<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T57Udzo4vozJhZxuxhvlZPymgWg\">N\u01a1i \u0111\u00e2y l\u01b0u tr\u1eef t\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 c\u00e1c &#8220;nguy\u00ean li\u1ec7u&#8221; cho chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n, bao g\u1ed3m:<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S9kgd7emOoY8qTx2kaplT0Kpgrf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>S\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n (Events):<\/strong> Qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd Pixel TikTok \u0111\u1ec3 theo d\u00f5i h\u00e0nh vi tr\u00ean website\/app.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AEOHdvJEHoCNWaxah6YlXtdsgfc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>N\u1ed9i dung (Creatives):<\/strong> Th\u01b0 vi\u1ec7n ch\u1ee9a t\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 video, h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RrkcdMkyxoJg05x2XG1lRn9lgXe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>\u0110\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng (Audiences):<\/strong> T\u1ea1o v\u00e0 qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd c\u00e1c t\u1ec7p \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng t\u00f9y ch\u1ec9nh v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u1ef1.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-XE1UdnS0zoBQCTxCbo4lYfS4gxg\">Tab B\u00e1o c\u00e1o (Reporting)<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZOSId5gtkoxuG8xQbSPlUGGeg9f\">Cung c\u1ea5p c\u00e1c c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 \u0111\u1ec3 b\u1ea1n t\u1ea1o ra nh\u1eefng b\u00e1o c\u00e1o t\u00f9y ch\u1ec9nh, ph\u00e2n t\u00edch s\u00e2u h\u01a1n v\u1ec1 hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 c\u1ee7a c\u00e1c chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch d\u1ef1a tr\u00ean nhi\u1ec1u ti\u00eau ch\u00ed kh\u00e1c nhau.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZrRIdYQ1jotQHWxQkl3l1b37gEh\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-M0aadTDLloivjpxgKZNldK1fgTe\">Hi\u1ec3u r\u00f5 c\u1ea5u tr\u00fac 3 l\u1edbp c\u1ee7a m\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o TikTok<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OFpodMTuEoE8DyxSoJeliWZTgUb\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-FlrZdiHVOoEllgx1cTklWwy0gYd\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;c26fef88-ab0f-4b4c-b970-3913ff67f141&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FAHXQbWNu2o5fxwxZM02ljtbNg3g%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;AHXQbWNu2o5fxwxZM02ljtbNg3g&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:194412,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5538\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5538\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5538\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/ada0cf49-9c0b-453e-97a5-43b6002288a8.png\" alt=\"Hi\u1ec3u r\u00f5 c\u1ea5u tr\u00fac 3 l\u1edbp c\u1ee7a m\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o TikTok\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/ada0cf49-9c0b-453e-97a5-43b6002288a8.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/ada0cf49-9c0b-453e-97a5-43b6002288a8-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/ada0cf49-9c0b-453e-97a5-43b6002288a8-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/ada0cf49-9c0b-453e-97a5-43b6002288a8-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/ada0cf49-9c0b-453e-97a5-43b6002288a8-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5538\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>Hi\u1ec3u r\u00f5 c\u1ea5u tr\u00fac 3 l\u1edbp c\u1ee7a m\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o TikTok<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UcG5dEmKeoh4Z0x07Brl6ZnXgHh\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CVMbdemTCoU6fBxkFH6ltjdZgzf\">\u0110\u1ec3 qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3, m\u1ecdi chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch tr\u00ean Tr\u00ecnh qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o TikTok \u0111\u1ec1u \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng theo c\u1ea5u tr\u00fac 3 c\u1ea5p. Vi\u1ec7c hi\u1ec3u r\u00f5 c\u1ea5u tr\u00fac n\u00e0y l\u00e0 n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng \u0111\u1ec3 b\u1ea1n thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch logic v\u00e0 t\u1ed1i \u01b0u.<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-MlS1dzM0LoOVWRxDs5vlYWTlg6s\">C\u1ea5p 1: Chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch (Campaign)<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IyJ0dh7Mtor8lCxpOjVlvvL8gNc\">\u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 c\u1ea5p cao nh\u1ea5t, gi\u1ed1ng nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfc &#8220;t\u1ee7 h\u1ed3 s\u01a1&#8221;. T\u1ea1i \u0111\u00e2y, b\u1ea1n s\u1ebd quy\u1ebft \u0111\u1ecbnh <strong>m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau t\u1ed5ng th\u1ec3<\/strong> cho t\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 c\u00e1c qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o b\u00ean trong n\u00f3. V\u00ed d\u1ee5: m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau l\u00e0 T\u0103ng l\u01b0\u1ee3t truy c\u1eadp website, T\u0103ng l\u01b0\u1ee3t chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i mua h\u00e0ng, hay T\u0103ng l\u01b0\u1ee3t c\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng.<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-GmnMdY6xjomqAjxgEfxlj44agxg\">C\u1ea5p 2: Nh\u00f3m qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o (Ad Group)<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DeOJdyXZAoCYrlxTeFjlBUaNgRR\">N\u1eb1m b\u00ean trong m\u1ed9t Chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch, m\u1ed7i Nh\u00f3m qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o gi\u1ed1ng nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t &#8220;ng\u0103n k\u00e9o&#8221; trong t\u1ee7 h\u1ed3 s\u01a1. \u1ede c\u1ea5p \u0111\u1ed9 n\u00e0y, b\u1ea1n s\u1ebd thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp:<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Beywdjm22oDMTkxAzFClxZK0gOc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>\u0110\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau:<\/strong> B\u1ea1n mu\u1ed1n qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb cho ai? (\u0111\u1ed9 tu\u1ed5i, s\u1edf th\u00edch, h\u00e0nh vi&#8230;).<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NOy8diJjJouRWzxA2NtlgmN3gPd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>V\u1ecb tr\u00ed hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb:<\/strong> Qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o s\u1ebd xu\u1ea5t hi\u1ec7n \u1edf \u0111\u00e2u? (ch\u1ec9 tr\u00ean TikTok, hay c\u1ea3 c\u00e1c \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c).<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Pc7sdAbp8o7fjPxqkphl0v4ZgLd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch &amp; L\u1ecbch ch\u1ea1y:<\/strong> B\u1ea1n s\u1ebd chi bao nhi\u00eau ti\u1ec1n v\u00e0 trong kho\u1ea3ng th\u1eddi gian n\u00e0o.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-T39pdHNuzoYuZvx5gv9lg9bwgEc\">C\u1ea5p 3: Qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o (Ad)<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-A5qZdOHVBo37rZxSng8lG8NmgAh\">\u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 c\u1ea5p cu\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng, l\u00e0 nh\u1eefng &#8220;t\u1ec7p t\u00e0i li\u1ec7u&#8221; n\u1eb1m trong m\u1ed7i ng\u0103n k\u00e9o. \u1ede c\u1ea5p \u0111\u1ed9 n\u00e0y, b\u1ea1n s\u1ebd t\u1ea3i l\u00ean v\u00e0 c\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t <strong>n\u1ed9i dung qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o c\u1ee5 th\u1ec3<\/strong> m\u00e0 ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng s\u1ebd nh\u00ecn th\u1ea5y, bao g\u1ed3m video, h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh, v\u0103n b\u1ea3n qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o v\u00e0 l\u1eddi k\u00eau g\u1ecdi h\u00e0nh \u0111\u1ed9ng (CTA).<\/div>\n<blockquote class=\" old-record-id-W3u3dA4DromHjlxS3cflwWMHg5f\" data-type=\"quote_container\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QmxId7TS4ofnfGxPz4Sl1a6qgub\">Vi\u1ec7c v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh v\u00e0 t\u1ed1i \u01b0u c\u1ea3 3 c\u1ea5p \u0111\u1ed9 n\u00e0y \u0111\u00f2i h\u1ecfi s\u1ef1 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p gi\u1eefa t\u01b0 duy chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c v\u00e0 k\u1ef9 n\u0103ng k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt khi\u1ebfn nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng b\u1ed1i r\u1ed1i. L\u00fac n\u00e0y, <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/dich-vu\/\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 t\u0103ng tr\u01b0\u1edfng TikTok Ads chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p<\/a><\/strong> c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 gi\u00fap h\u1ecd t\u1eeb vi\u1ec7c l\u00ean k\u1ebf ho\u1ea1ch, l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau, ph\u00e2n b\u1ed5 ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch cho \u0111\u1ebfn s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o n\u1ed9i dung, \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n \u0111\u1ea1t hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 cao nh\u1ea5t.<\/div>\n<\/blockquote>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y9A5dv3sUoKsFPxhonVlNrVNg4e\">T\u00f3m l\u1ea1i, vi\u1ec7c n\u1eafm v\u1eefng <strong>Tr\u00ecnh qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o TikTok<\/strong>, t\u1eeb giao di\u1ec7n t\u1ed5ng quan \u0111\u1ebfn c\u1ea5u tr\u00fac 3 l\u1edbp c\u1ee7a m\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch, ch\u00ednh l\u00e0 b\u01b0\u1edbc \u0111i n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng v\u00e0 quan tr\u1ecdng nh\u1ea5t \u0111\u1ec3 b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u h\u00e0nh tr\u00ecnh qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng n\u00e0y. \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 m\u1ea1nh m\u1ebd, cung c\u1ea5p cho b\u1ea1n \u0111\u1ea7y \u0111\u1ee7 quy\u1ec1n n\u0103ng \u0111\u1ec3 ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn \u0111\u00fang kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 \u0111o l\u01b0\u1eddng hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Xhw6di2fWogc46xyvhClj2RWg7d\">Tuy nhi\u00ean, vi\u1ec7c hi\u1ec3u c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 b\u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\u1ea7u. \u0110\u1ec3 bi\u1ebfn nh\u1eefng chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o th\u00e0nh c\u1ed7 m\u00e1y mang l\u1ea1i l\u1ee3i nhu\u1eadn th\u1ef1c s\u1ef1, b\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n m\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c b\u00e0i b\u1ea3n, s\u1ef1 s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o trong n\u1ed9i dung v\u00e0 kinh nghi\u1ec7m t\u1ed1i \u01b0u li\u00ean t\u1ee5c. N\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n mu\u1ed1n \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t kho\u1ea3n \u0111\u1ea7u t\u01b0 x\u1ee9ng \u0111\u00e1ng, h\u00e3y t\u00ecm \u0111\u1ebfn s\u1ef1 t\u01b0 v\u1ea5n v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed3ng h\u00e0nh t\u1eeb c\u00e1c chuy\u00ean gia t\u1ea1i <strong>Lemon Digital<\/strong>.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DFBJdFzuxoWjKCx8zTNlb15mg3e\">Ch\u00fang t\u00f4i s\u1ebd gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng v\u00e0 v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh c\u00e1c chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3, t\u1ed1i \u0111a h\u00f3a l\u1ee3i nhu\u1eadn tr\u00ean chi ph\u00ed qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o (ROAS) v\u00e0 \u0111\u01b0a th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n b\u1ec1n v\u1eefng.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RbmzdXYshoFz4CxNCVKlLcYCgSu\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVjXdDM1QoMZ6mxIT8Zl9DE7g1g\">\n<div data-page-id=\"V0Kidqy2IocGzOxLzIxlADkBgoc\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FnMpdlmeroUMmBxzO45lyb2Lg8f\"><strong>C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N LEMON DIGITAL<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CiNPdL9yGogrOWx5SP9lClWZgQe\"><strong>\u0110\u1ecba ch\u1ec9: <\/strong>202 Phan V\u0103n H\u00e2n, Ph\u01b0\u1eddng Gia \u0110\u1ecbnh, H\u1ed3 Ch\u00ed Minh, Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BXbIdAJxhoMK78xlitmlwna7gJi\"><strong>\u0110i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i: <\/strong>0938785735<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-D4zHdkc9moG0p4xCDsMlPfuCgLg\"><strong>Email: <\/strong><strong><a href=\"mailto:hi@lemondigital.vn\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">hi@lemondigital.vn<\/a><\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-I1zOdpTlKoctbZx2CeclelbEgNe\"><strong>Website: <\/strong><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/<\/a><\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PLSVdBWXkoC8WCxZhallVoJrgfc\"><strong>Facebook: <\/strong><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/lemondigital.vn\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Lemon Digital<\/a><\/strong><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>\u0110\u1ec3 khai th\u00e1c t\u1ed1i \u0111a ti\u1ec1m n\u0103ng th\u01b0\u01a1ng m\u1ea1i kh\u1ed5ng l\u1ed3 t\u1eeb TikTok, vi\u1ec7c hi\u1ec3u v\u00e0 l\u00e0m ch\u1ee7 Tr\u00ecnh qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o TikTok l\u00e0 b\u01b0\u1edbc \u0111i kh\u00f4ng th\u1ec3 thi\u1ebfu c\u1ee7a m\u1ecdi doanh nghi\u1ec7p. \u0110\u00e2y ch\u00ednh l\u00e0 trung t\u00e2m ch\u1ec9 huy, n\u01a1i b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o ra c\u00e1c chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o, ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn ch\u00ednh [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":5,"featured_media":5716,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[29,1],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-5448","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-kien-thuc-tiktok","category-tin-tuc"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/